<Highlight slug="zero-server" lede="utilyx.dev runs every tool in your browser. No uploads, no queues, no backend to scale — which makes it faster, cheaper and private by default.">
	<section style="padding-top: 64px">
		<h2 class="lbl">Why zero-server</h2>
		<ul class="bl">
			<li><span><b>Instant.</b> No network round trip between you and the result.</span></li>
			<li><span><b>Private.</b> Your JSON, tokens and files never leave your machine.</span></li>
			<li><span><b>Cheap to run.</b> A static site costs almost nothing, however many people use it.</span></li>
		</ul>
	</section>
	<section style="padding-top: 64px">
		<h2 class="lbl">The product</h2>
		<p style="margin: 0; color: var(--mut)">See the full story on the <a href="/work/utilyx" class="ilink">utilyx.dev project page</a>.</p>
	</section>
</Highlight>
